<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="OBA" style="id">Obadiah</book>
  <para style="h">Obadiah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Obadiah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Obadiah</para>
  <para style="mt">Obadiah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Obadia inlârna hmuh chu. Lalpa Pathian chuan Edom chungchângah heti hian a ti: Lalpa hnên ata thu kan hria a; hnamte zîngah palai tirh a ni, “Tho ula, indonaah amah do tûrin i thawk ang u,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ngai teh, hnamte zîngah ka titê tawh che a ni; nasa taka hmuhsitin i awm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw nang, lungpui keh kâra chênga, hmun sâng luahtu, ‘Tuin nge leiah mi tithla ang?’ ti rilrutu, i thinlung chaponain a bum ta che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mu angin sâng takah thlâwk chho mah la, i bu chu arsi zînga chheh pawh ni mah sela, chuta ta chu ka la thla ang che,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“I hnênah rûkrute, phil hmangte zânah lo kal sela (tihboral i va ni dâwn nasa êm!), an duhtâwkin an ru lo vang em ni? I hnênah grêp seng khâwmtute lo kal sela, grêp seng tûr ṭhenkhat an hnutchhiah lo vang em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Esauva thilte zawn chhuah a nih tâk chu! A ro bâwm thuhrûkte dap chhuah a nih tâk chu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I lama ṭanghote zawng zawngin ramri hial an rawn thlen che a; mi inrem taka i awmpuite khân an bum che a, an hneh tawh che a ni. I chhang eitute khân i hnuaiah thang an kam a; amahah chuan hriat thiamna rêng a awm lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan Edom ata mi fingte ka tiboralin, Esauva tlâng ata hriat thiamna ka tiboral lo vang em ni?” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Teman, Esauva tlâng ata mi tin thah borala an awm vekna tûrin, i mi chakte chu nasa takin an zâm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I unaupa Jakoba chunga i pâwngnêkna avângin zahnain a khuh ang che a, kumkhuaa tihboralin i awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lehlama i din nia, mikhualten a sum an lâk bo nia, hnam dang mite a kulh kawngkhâra an lo luha, Jerusalem chunga ṭhum an vâwr lai khân, nang pawh anmahni zînga tel angin i awm kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, i unaupa a chhiat laia a chhiatna ni chu thlîr suh la, Juda fate chungah an boral niin lâwm suh la; hrehawm niin chapo takin ṭawng hek suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka mite an vânduai niin an kulh kawngkâah lût suh; a ni, an vânduai niin an tuarnate thlîr suh la, an vânduai niin an sum leh paite chungah in kutte nghat hek suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A mi ṭhenkhat tlân chhuakte that tûrin kawng ṭhuamah ding suh la; hrehawm nia a mi la awm chhunte chu mantîr suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hnam zawng zawng chungah Lalpa nî chu a hnai si a; i lo tih tawh ang bawkin i chungah tih a ni ang; i tih dân chu i lu chung ngeiah a lo lêt ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka tlâng thianghlima in in tâk ang khân, hnam zawng zawngte chuan an in fo dâwn si a; a ni, an in ang a, an lem ang a, piang lo ang maiin an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zion tlângah erawh chuan tlân chhuakte chu an awm ang a, a thianghlim ang; tin, Jakoba chhûngte chuan ro chante chu an chang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jakoba chhûngte chu mei an ni ang a, Josefa chhûngte chu mei alh an ni ang; Esauva chhûngte chu buhpâwl an ni ang a; anmahni zîngah an alh ang a, an kâng ral vek ang, Esauva chhûngte chu a bâng rêng an awm lo vang,” Lalpa chuan a ti ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chhim lam mite chuan Esauva tlâng chu an chang ang a, ram phaia mite chuan Philistia ram an chang ang: Ephraima lo leh Samaria lo chu an chang ang: Benjamina chuan Gilead ram a chang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kanaan mite zînga he Israela thlah sal tâng mipuite hian Zarephath ram thlengin an chang ang a; Sepharad rama Jerusalem khaw mi sal tângte chuan Chhim lam khawpuite chu an chang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zion tlângah chuan Esauva tlâng rêlsak tûra chhan chhuaktute chu an chho vang a; tin, ram chu Lalpa ta a ni ang.
  </para>
</usx>
